{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1472662-a-thought-on-trinity-continuim","id":1472662,"title":"A thought on Trinity Continuim","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-01-18T07:00:03-08:00","id":1472662,"title":"A thought on Trinity Continuim","content":"I just got the book about 3 weeks ago and have been going over it. The themes, the rules. First thing is first, I like it. Back in the d20 craze there was this game that WotC made called D20 Modern, and I thought it was awesome. Did it have it's flaws, yes. Did Wizards have any idea on how to market the game, no. So it's this weird game on my shelf that never could reach the popularity of its older brother and since it didn't print money, wizards dropped it and never looked back. <br /> Trinity does what D20 Modern promised and did but better. It fixed the scaling issues that plagued other decendants of the storytelling system. It's also a managable tight book, unlike Exalted 3rd which scares off everybody, don't get me wrong I love me some exalted, but showing up to a table with a book that can be used to kill large animals is a tough sell.<br /> There is just one tiny issue, and it kind of bummed me out. The language, this book could be a fantastic means of introducing younger players to the games of Onyx Path, but some of the content in the book is on the risqu\u00e9 side. The word fuck was used several times, often in a lazy &quot;I'm just trying to be edgy&quot; way. Don't get me wrong, I use that word a lot, it's one of my favorites, but I also know when not to use it. Listen I know I'm sounding like an old fuddy duddy, but I do have nieces and nephews, who are young enough and whose parents would like them to not be exposed to that word, and other adult concepts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-18T08:32:47-08:00","id":1472670,"title":"","content":"I just used Ctrl+F and could only find one instance of the F bomb.Did you mean curse words in general are used frequently? If so, were they used outside of dialogue? I ask because dialogue is something based on the character being written. As you said, you curse yourself and so it is something that is used by people often.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-18T12:52:52-08:00","id":1472690,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>thedonnie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1472662-a-thought-on-trinity-continuim?p=1472670#post1472670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just used Ctrl+F and could only find one instance of the F bomb.Did you mean curse words in general are used frequently? If so, were they used outside of dialogue? I ask because dialogue is something based on the character being written. As you said, you curse yourself and so it is something that is used by people often.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not a question of would real people say these words, they can they do, and often its quite worse, but I thought this game would make a great gift to my ten year old nephew whose mormon, and well darn. A crap, a damn or even a shit would be pushing it, but fuck is just too fucking far. Not saying other books in the line can't be harder rated but some youth rated material would be grand.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1435-videopete","name":"videopete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1435_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"111"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-18T14:42:29-08:00","id":1472696,"title":"","content":"As there is only one, you could get it...put a marker and color over it...then hand it to your nephew. There is only one instance of it in the core book that I could find.<br /> There are four uses of the word &quot;shit&quot; though.<br /> But, again, one and only one F-bomb.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":786,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","user":"thedonnie","date":". 01-18-2022, 05:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-19T04:14:45-08:00","id":1472764,"title":"","content":"I got Mormons in the family too (actually, my parents &amp; siblings), so I feel your pain mate...<br /> <br /> ...that said, this is a game that's meant to emulate action heroes from the movies. Dropping an F-bomb or saying &quot;shit&quot; <i><b>is</b></i> a part of the genre. As amusing as the mental image is, John McClane isn't quite the same saying <i>&quot;Yippee-ki-yay, you rascal&quot;</i> and they even dropped gave Samuel L. Jackson an implied <i>&quot;motherf\u016bcker&quot;</i> in his Marvel movies (with a senator actually saying &quot;fuck you&quot; outright in Ironman 2, but bleeped out).<br /> <br /> If you absolutely, positively have to kill every last curse in the book: AK-47, er, <i>permanent marker</i> - accept no substitutes. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26905-eternl-knight","name":"Eternl Knight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26905_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-01-20T03:47:37-08:00","id":1472865,"title":"","content":"I wonder how the kids parents handle the other implications of violence and the (implied) non consensual acts described and the progessive worldview of the book(s).<br /> <br /> If a one time appearance of &quot;fuck&quot; is a deal breaker than you should not gift it or maybe better like Eternl Knight said: censor the one print of &quot;fuck&quot; in it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Gamelines: Requiem, Lost, Awakening, Trinity Continuum: Aeon, some V5.<br /> Likes cheesecake (quark-based)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1305-maekkel","name":"maekkel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1305_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"206"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}